Hindi ka naman nasaktan kahapon diba?

313
00:24:54.159 --> 00:24:55.577
Matagal na tayong hindi nagkikita.

314
00:24:55.660 --> 00:24:57.120
Kamusta ka, okay ka lang?

315
00:25:03.168 --> 00:25:04.419
Makinig, parang

316
00:25:06.004 --> 00:25:07.714
Hindi uurong si Gu.

317
00:25:08.882 --> 00:25:11.092
Hindi mahalaga kung gaano ka kagaling, okay?

318
00:25:12.052 --> 00:25:14.554
Hindi ka laban sa kanya, ngunit laban sa buong Bonsan.

319
00:25:15.096 --> 00:25:17.349
Kung hindi ka umatras, napakadelikado.

320
00:25:17.432 --> 00:25:20.810
Sa lahat ng Bonsan - kasama ka ba diyan?

321
00:25:27.275 --> 00:25:29.110
Well, itigil mo na.

322
00:25:33.448 --> 00:25:34.866
Naalala ko kung paano sa nakaraan

323
00:25:36.451 --> 00:25:38.078
